cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AquaPilot in teaching, research or a comparison study, cite this repository."
title: "AquaPilot: an AI-operated wastewater treatment plant simulator"
abstract: >-
  A runnable open-source prototype that couples a topology-driven ASM1/Takács
  wastewater treatment simulator with a rolling-horizon AI operator, a
  fixed-perturbation uncertainty layer and an auditable flowsheet editor.
authors:
  - name: "AquaPilot contributors"
license: MIT
